@startuml Agent 交互时序图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxmessagesize 60
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Consul Agent 核心交互时序图

participant "外部客户端" as Client
participant "HTTPHandlers" as HTTP
participant "Agent" as Agent
participant "local.State" as LocalState
participant "ae.StateSyncer" as Syncer
participant "delegate" as Delegate
participant "cache.Cache" as Cache
participant "ServiceManager" as ServiceMgr
participant "checks.CheckHTTP" as CheckHTTP

== Agent 启动流程 ==

Client -> Agent: New(baseDeps)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent.go:444\n创建 Agent 实例

Agent -> Agent: 初始化组件
note right: 初始化各种检查映射\n设置状态锁和通道

Agent -> LocalState: NewState(config, logger, tokens)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/local/state.go:225\n创建本地状态管理器

Agent -> Syncer: NewStateSyncer(state, interval, shutdownCh, logger)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/ae/ae.go:120\n创建反熵同步器

Agent -> ServiceMgr: NewServiceManager(agent)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/service_manager.go:41\n创建服务管理器

Agent -> HTTP: NewHTTPHandlers(agent, denylist)
note right: 创建 HTTP 处理器

Client -> Agent: Start(ctx)
note right: 启动 Agent 服务

Agent -> Delegate: 根据配置创建 Server 或 Client
note right: delegate 接口实现\n位置: agent/agent.go:155

Agent -> Syncer: Run()
note right: 启动反熵同步

Agent -> HTTP: 启动 HTTP 服务器
note right: 监听 HTTP 请求

== 服务注册流程 ==

Client -> HTTP: PUT /v1/agent/service/register
note right: HTTP API 调用

HTTP -> HTTP: AgentRegisterService()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent_endpoint.go:1150\n解析注册请求

HTTP -> Agent: AddService(req)
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/agent.go:2347\n添加服务到 Agent

Agent -> Agent: addServiceLocked(req)
note right: 获取状态锁\n验证服务配置

Agent -> Agent: validateService()
note right: 验证服务定义

Agent -> LocalState: AddServiceWithChecks(service, checks, token, locallyRegistered)
note right: 添加服务到本地状态

LocalState -> LocalState: 更新服务映射
note right: services[serviceID] = serviceState\n标记为未同步

Agent -> ServiceMgr: AddService(req)
note right: 如果是代理服务\n添加到服务管理器

Agent -> Agent: 创建健康检查
note right: 根据检查类型创建\n对应的检查实例

Agent -> CheckHTTP: NewCheckHTTP(...)
note right: 创建 HTTP 检查\n位置: agent/checks/check.go:333

Agent -> CheckHTTP: Start()
note right: 启动健康检查

Agent -> LocalState: TriggerSyncChanges()
note right: 触发反熵同步

LocalState -> Syncer: SyncChangesEvent()
note right: 通知同步器有变更

== 反熵同步流程 ==

Syncer -> Syncer: syncChangesEventFn()
note right: 处理同步变更事件

Syncer -> LocalState: SyncChanges()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/local/state.go:1245\n同步本地状态变更

LocalState -> LocalState: 检查需要同步的服务
note right: 遍历未同步的服务

LocalState -> Delegate: RPC("Catalog.Register", args, reply)
note right: 调用 Catalog 注册 RPC

Delegate -> Delegate: 处理 RPC 调用
note right: 转发到 Consul 服务器\n或本地处理

LocalState -> LocalState: 标记服务已同步
note right: service.InSync = true

== 健康检查流程 ==

CheckHTTP -> CheckHTTP: check()
note right: 定期执行健康检查

CheckHTTP -> CheckHTTP: 发送 HTTP 请求
note right: 根据配置的 URL\n发送健康检查请求

CheckHTTP -> LocalState: UpdateCheck(checkID, status, output)
note right: 更新检查状态

LocalState -> LocalState: 更新检查映射
note right: checks[checkID].Status = status

LocalState -> Syncer: TriggerSyncChanges()
note right: 触发同步检查状态

== 服务发现流程 ==

Client -> HTTP: GET /v1/health/service/web
note right: 查询服务健康状态

HTTP -> HTTP: HealthServiceNodes()
note right: 代码位置:\nagent/health_endpoint.go\n处理健康查询

HTTP -> Cache: Get(ctx, "health", request)
note right: 从缓存获取数据

Cache -> Cache: 检查缓存是否有效
note right: 检查 TTL 和索引

alt 缓存未命中或过期
    Cache -> Delegate: RPC("Health.ServiceNodes", args, reply)
    note right: 调用健康检查 RPC
    
    Delegate -> Cache: 返回查询结果
    note right: 更新缓存条目
end

Cache -> HTTP: 返回服务健康状态
HTTP -> Client: JSON 响应

== 配置重载流程 ==

Client -> Agent: ReloadConfig(newConfig)
note right: 重载配置

Agent -> Agent: 验证新配置
note right: 配置验证和处理

Agent -> HTTP: ReloadConfig(newConfig)
note right: 重载 HTTP 处理器配置

Agent -> LocalState: 更新配置相关状态
note right: 更新本地状态配置

Agent -> Agent: 重启相关组件
note right: 重启需要重新配置的组件

== Agent 关闭流程 ==

Client -> Agent: Shutdown()
note right: 关闭 Agent

Agent -> Syncer: 停止同步器
note right: 停止反熵同步

Agent -> Agent: 停止所有健康检查
note right: 遍历并停止所有检查

Agent -> CheckHTTP: Stop()
note right: 停止 HTTP 检查

Agent -> ServiceMgr: Stop()
note right: 停止服务管理器

Agent -> Delegate: Shutdown()
note right: 关闭 delegate

Agent -> HTTP: 关闭 HTTP 服务器
note right: 停止 HTTP 监听

Agent -> Agent: 清理资源
note right: 关闭通道和清理状态

@enduml
